{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMX Streets is a next generation physics driven freestyle extreme biking simulator. BMX Streets captures the essence of BMX culture by giving players the ability to find their own style of riding through practice, experimentation, and exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Revolutionary Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bumpers are your hands, triggers are your feet. BMX Streets puts you in complete control of your bike, whether its on the ground, in the air, or grinding down a handrail. The perfect balance of accessibility and depth, the control system allows you fully express yourself, from learning the basics to pushing the limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMX Streets physics make riding anything fun. Get technical on ledges and rails, send huge roof drops or thread your way around backyard bowls; it's all about your style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your bike to match your style with over 1,000 bike parts. Collect parts to build your dream bike that not only looks good, but lets your ride the way you want to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hit the Streets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMX Streets\u2019 maps are built by riders for riders. Find your best line, session a new spot, and share your best tricks with replay editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We built BMX Streets to be the ultimate BMX video game experience, but we aren\u2019t stopping there\u2026 we can\u2019t wait to show you what we have in the pipeline. Look out for updates coming soon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics Based BMX Riding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern Control System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tweak System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMX Customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pro Riders</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Stats Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod Support</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Cult","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/871540/907b76df292f741d1abd067a5b246140f97a2e18.jpg"},{"name":"Air Head","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/871540/73c03cd432cb9f2fda6187086cc0c302d94f18c6.jpg"},{"name":"Balancing Act","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/871540/11c4f298e778d0da3e74cd4d58408f7a1db42151.jpg"},{"name":"Lunch Special","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/871540/bbf6ee2ecb7ec77710c107c3c14a0aa1ebe07521.jpg"},{"name":"Yo Dawg","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/871540/9ebbfee125d5c4c6297e2623f1b4f014a97faaed.jpg"},{"name":"GenZ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/871540/303d38333fa49018dec58c5fcedaddad798b0d73.jpg"},{"name":"Sigma Grind Set","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/871540/26b11e325a038b4fa602dd1f9459260823173ae0.jpg"},{"name":"Hitting Legendary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/871540/74666e59898b3f9c165c17760f9fc93bbe91a6e4.jpg"},{"name":"Fidget Spinner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/871540/0933cd7d76b7ab0e45ccef261b9982d7c14080bb.jpg"},{"name":"Giga Chad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/871540/9b7a9ed805ee6c3b040d81851d98a277f4168580.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/871540?t=1769795771","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/871540/5a1b6892765d113ccf8b493041f7a32b71a3e0f5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769795771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co